{pad:meta title='Sequence types', about='The first terms of three famous sequences, and one ended by stop - the term that reaches 100 included.'/}
<p>Primes: {sequence:prime rows=10}{$prime} {/sequence:prime}</p>
<p>Fibonacci: {sequence:fibonacci rows=10}{$fibonacci} {/sequence:fibonacci}</p>
<p>Triangular: {sequence:triangular rows=8}{$sequence} {/sequence:triangular}</p>
<p>Fibonacci, stop=100: {sequence:fibonacci stop=100}{$sequence} {/sequence:fibonacci}</p>
